<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Enzo Maresca seemed, if not quite baffled =
by his side=E2=80=99s <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/s=
s/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgqt=
HAaykc17BJ2m2mgIMoSTGW8icHO7rsUw0xkPMqbQTWhlgaJSbNwOnjQ0yoWwZQvdv_sPqIy3UQT=
N0lfR0YqfOTEgNfOrfpGZcIC2rfwKD5wUIrvEYZ4A-vQGJK5MxmJSxLAaiFu_6WoO_h1AGW0iAK=
Ml6oiBUmLM3lhgRpABAGsDf4v9QX9rEIy4G7V0uUQBfgYpjvoVbA4zZRyDTXAiQD2-Hd7IlWBrt=
ftBsPkwgGZ_NalEnmW2tWO3m0tAQyjwJLccbFWLCn8Vmju7nQ2M4859k4KNnA0MejCbebgeM/4v=
l/wm5I3eCNTHmmT6TbO1gCwQ/h6/h001.8JbyIQnFbkmSyQ1KHQ31J4YOy-1MlhX5QS434CnA7p=
s" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Saturday defeat</a> to Nottingham Forest, then=
 at least a little put out. After seven straight wins from the start of the=
 season, that=E2=80=99s now three straight defeats, a pattern so unusual th=
at it=E2=80=99s been recorded only once before in top-flight English histor=
y, by Sheffield Wednesday in 1904-05. The three defeats were all different,=
 Maresca said, although in all of them City had had more possession and mor=
e chances.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In the <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial=
.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhY=
SJYcaNsDra0BxnPg1DRhE8QGyD94KNTfKM1MW7bLXW7bGz67e0j9s1VlcEkqtXKQuzB1nwK5rZN=
HSW3sOhT5mv6dWZ8DAkTK4xRIU6q9QIgBwtnVS7dnnizTGVtqxT_PjOJPJVAd2UEWZ64z2tYY0o=
usYYyB-uFBoaHdneL5m_Kiprx77TT7Pv3BC3e7CYyNySlUqbET3olwt9oPfN9A60FHoRSKv0Gfv=
NsUwd_lSnLRVOaZzR8agf4bzmzEAfGf4TkqZ6mKGDkHx8auauh_QmPO2zA1FXVGgqaOFlyaP2Hq=
Vj_Mzry-WplbaPs/4vl/wm5I3eCNTHmmT6TbO1gCwQ/h7/h001.Ghh-C9nZKxZsPWJT8JslbLXJ=
3LNhWrL25v3t_nhJ1zg" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">2-1</a> defeat at Aston Vill=
a two weeks ago, City had 63% of the ball and had 15 chances to Villa=E2=80=
=99s eight. In the <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c=
/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0BxnPgc_6Wo=
2ZSJGbIIrJxKPSACk3zI63kePWgtxBJaLAskqygjiiuRPRNMh9qFvjg8TZD4fpTQBtMLG6B80UE=
KwVVM3Y1J0w_mZG4xs4z1qUlZ9nhWz0WR1l0u55KG_PpOVqWAvy1vofdeITCr_CcC-jHf6C7_iy=
m9ZcfRyJ_fGRHgJ_FUVEnR5gAC14n8FLLdPgZHS3ipuGXeKKePI10GKOE73n-4iPHzv44fOk6Lk=
E4rLXbz6mrwuK7iOk_FNE3DV3Su38zLAVz42NFjiZ9hhPSTw/4vl/wm5I3eCNTHmmT6TbO1gCwQ=
/h8/h001.B45U_chxBnbftvl-xaYLie3_HmGEzbC_Ty8uzpjqBIU" style=3D"color: #0077=
B6;">1-0</a> home defeat to Brighton last weekend, they had 62% possession =
and 21 chances to seven. At the City Ground, it was 79% possession and 12 c=
hances to 11. So Maresca is right in one way: City could look at basic stat=
istics and say they had been unfortunate =E2=80=93 although Forest could eq=
ually point to the fact that they went into that game third top of the expe=
cted goals table but second-bottom of the actual table.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">But there is another statistic that should=
 concern Maresca: City have not kept a clean sheet since their victory at A=
nfield after the last international break, nine games ago. And the game bef=
ore that, they let in three against Sunderland. In those last eight games, =
City have conceded 17 goals. It=E2=80=99s true that three of those can at l=
east in part be blamed on errors by Gianluigi Donnarumma, but there are als=
o structural issues. City have a vulnerability in transition that Forest ru=
thlessly exploited, a weakness not unfamiliar to Maresca=E2=80=99s teams. O=
ne of the criticisms he received at both Leicester and Chelsea was that his=
 sides were often extremely cautious in possession, but that makes sense gi=
ven how high a line he likes to play.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">That=E2=80=99s also why duels are so cruci=
al to his teams; losing possession immediately exposes a high back four. Ma=
resca was visibly disappointed at the way City were outfought in the first =
half against Forest. Lose the ball and the opposition has a run at a back f=
our with space behind it. That is always going to be a problem but especial=
ly so when the opposing center-forward is a Liam Delap who has just remembe=
red how to play and is determined to make somebody pay for a year and a bit=
 of disappointing form.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Yet the midfield Maresca picked was clearl=
y vulnerable to being outmuscled. He clearly rates Enzo Fern=C3=A1ndez extr=
emely highly, to the point that City paid =C2=A3125m ($167.7m) to sign him =
from Chelsea. But Fern=C3=A1ndez, for all his gifts as a footballer, is not=
 especially physical by the standards of the Premier League. When he and Co=
le Palmer played together, there was often a sense that it made Chelsea a l=
ittle lightweight. Maresca, though, was so determined to field the Argentin=
ian that he would come up with complex tactical solutions, such as using Ma=
lo Gusto as a weird right-back-cum-No-10 hybrid.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">City are running into similar problems. Ra=
yan Cherki is an enormously gifted attacking midfielder, but not one who ca=
n be relied upon defensively, either in terms of his positioning or his wil=
lingness to make tracking runs, something Pep Guardiola acknowledged last s=
eason. He can be physically outmatched. That is not necessarily a huge prob=
lem with two mobile runners behind him: ideally an Elliot Anderson-style sh=
uttler and a more defensive holding and/or ball-winning presence like Rodri=
. But Rodri has gone and Fern=C3=A1ndez leaves Anderson with a huge amount =
of the physical work to do. If Anderson happens not to be on the spot =E2=
=80=93 if, say, a defender loses the ball in a dangerous area, or a break b=
ypasses him =E2=80=93 City are very quickly exposed.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Maresca said he will use this internationa=
l break to reassess, that this was a rare example where it was better for a=
 team not to have another game straight away to try to put a defeat behind =
them. Perhaps there is a tactical solution to be found. Perhaps even one th=
at isn=E2=80=99t just: don=E2=80=99t play Fern=C3=A1ndez and Cherki togethe=
r. But he must also be aware that by the time the Premier League returns, C=
ity could be out of the title race, or effectively even out of the Premier =
League itself.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It was during the last international break=
 that the independent panel <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian=
.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEBgtjhYSJYcaNsDra0B=
xnPgeL94mxcX9c0olhmChWavhoNVudA2NvuazBa_-CaUqhB1Abhu-FrDJOvR08xnUJ8CATbGtP4=
A5QXCvYg8zrs5MpT5dp0DVimFI7C5xfI1Fsxx-sec_wV7GUYdhfWQ4A-QRffDgu-C0eAr6BEfN4=
zjfCbThlAVq8XyuI1oyQYRoRvKJd5qGO_N2nKd_RzvBwkfPFslPrP6i2ZWfqcz_QZhp_3Vw2dP5=
VdaXyD5lH2D_PBYkBxOtZDR8khYLJASR7czPIM_oVbw5bfYHkJKw3_99Kr8QzZlAXXGo5hPAJ_9=
sH84G8HaHLfB3ljntnUcChLm/4vl/wm5I3eCNTHmmT6TbO1gCwQ/h9/h001.eVudPkAHCDCkqiz=
vl41u23USozpLJ1PPUSpRnSWObwY" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">announced</a> City =
had been found guilty of all but one of the charges brought against them by=
 the Premier League. There is a school of thought that the sanctions could =
be announced during this international break. It=E2=80=99s all but impossib=
le, of course, to know precisely how it=E2=80=99s affecting players to play=
 under the cloud of a potential huge points deduction, but if initial defia=
nce has faded into a sullen acceptance, that may also lead to battles being=
 lost, to a lack of intensity and desire.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The issue is tactical, but it may not only=
 be tactical.</p>
