<em><strong style=3D"color: #0077B6; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700;"=
>Inter v Man City</strong></em> is at 3pm on Paramount+.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;"><strong>Wednesday: </strong>OL Lyonnes are=
 one of two teams in the Women=E2=80=99s Champions League to enjoy a double=
